# Budgie MP1 agent workflow

Always read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/Reflections.md` before coding.

- One feature increment per session. Do not implement later backlog items early.
- After each increment: `./gradlew check`, keep `docs/UserGuide.md` accurate, write `logs/NN-*.md` with reflection notes.
- Never overwrite Joseph's first-person deep dives in `docs/Reflections.md`.
- Never add a Features.md file.
